# Complete NFTBAN Login Monitoring System - Installation & Usage Guide

## Overview

This enhanced NFTBAN system provides comprehensive login monitoring with intelligent email detection, sophisticated alerting, and advanced security features.

## New Features Added

### 🔐 **Login Monitoring**
- **SSH Login Alerts** - Monitor all SSH connections with user/IP details
- **Root Login Detection** - CRITICAL alerts for any root access
- **Sudo Command Monitoring** - Track privileged command execution
- **Failed Login Tracking** - Alert on repeated failed attempts

### 📧 **Smart Email Detection** 
- **Auto-detect** Postfix, Exim, Sendmail, MSMTP, SSMTP
- **Auto-install** Postfix if no email system found
- **Email testing** built-in functionality

### 🛡️ **Enhanced Security**
- **GeoIP Integration** - Location data for suspicious IPs
- **WHOIS Lookup** - Network ownership information
- **Threat Assessment** - Risk scoring for IP addresses
- **Command Analysis** - Categorize sudo commands by risk level

