## Advanced Configuration

### Custom Service Monitoring

Create additional templates for your specific services:

```bash
# Create custom template
sudo nano /etc/fail2ban/jail-templates.d/my-app.conf.template
```

```ini
[my-application]
enabled = true
port = 8080,8443
filter = my-app-filter
backend = ${NFTBAN_F2B_BACKEND}
maxretry = 3
findtime = 300
bantime = ${NFTBAN_F2B_DEF_BAN_TIME}
ignoreip = ${NFTBAN_F2B_IGNOREIP}
logpath = /var/log/my-app/error.log
action = nftables-multiport[name=MyApp, port="8080,8443"]
         $(test "${NFTBAN_F2B_ALERT_ENABLED}" = "true" && echo "nftban-login-email[name=MyApp]")
```

### Environment-Specific Configurations

**Development Environment:**
```bash
NFTBAN_F2B_ALERT_ENABLED="false"        # Disable email alerts
