## Security Best Practices

### 1. **Email Security**
```bash
# Use authenticated SMTP for external delivery
# Configure SPF/DKIM records for your domain
# Use encrypted connections when possible
```

### 2. **Log Protection** 
```bash
# Secure log files
sudo chmod 640 /var/log/nftban-login-monitor.log
sudo chown root:adm /var/log/nftban-login-monitor.log

# Enable log rotation
sudo systemctl enable logrotate.timer
```

### 3. **Network Security**
```bash
# Ensure nftables is active
sudo systemctl enable nftables
sudo systemctl start nftables

# Monitor nftables rules
sudo nft list tables
sudo nft list table inet filter
```

### 4. **Regular Maintenance**
```bash
# Weekly security review
sudo fail2ban-client status | grep "Number of jail:"
sudo grep "CRITICAL\|HIGH" /var/log/nftban-login-monitor.log

# Monthly configuration review  
sudo fail2ban-template-generator.sh --validate-only
```

