## Monitoring and Alerting

### Key Log Files

| File | Purpose | Location |
|------|---------|----------|
| NFTBAN Monitor | Login events, alerts | `/var/log/nftban-login-monitor.log` |
| Fail2ban | Ban/unban events | `/var/log/fail2ban.log` |
| Auth Logs | System authentication | `/var/log/auth.log` |
| Mail Logs | Email delivery | `/var/log/mail.log` |

### Alert Categories

**CRITICAL (Immediate Action Required):**
- Root login from remote IP
- Multiple high-risk sudo commands
- System compromise indicators

**HIGH (Review Within Hours):**
- Repeated failed login attempts
- Suspicious user activity
- High-risk command execution

**MEDIUM (Daily Review):**
- SSH login patterns
- Standard sudo usage
- Fail2ban activations

**LOW (Weekly Review):**
- System status updates
- Configuration changes
- Routine maintenance alerts

